smb: client: use smbdirect_send_batch processing

jira KERNEL-1677
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8
commit-author Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>
commit 2c1ac39ce9cd4112f406775c626eef7f3eb4c481
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8/2c1ac39c.failed

This will allow us to use similar logic as we have in
the server soon, so that we can share common code later.

	Cc: <stable@vger.kernel.org> # 6.18.x
